From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:15:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(2d): close a U-shaped blind slot against stock

Use the existing open-chain split for a validated blind-slot cap.
Pin three-family generation, extension, named refusals, and blocked posting.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1762
